^FileSystemService\.	a sandbox file transfer API (upload, download, list, search, permissions)
^GitService\.	a git API
^LspServerService\.	an LSP API
^(ComputerUseService|MouseService|KeyboardService|ScreenshotService|DisplayService|RecordingService|AccessibilityService)\.	a desktop automation API
^CodeInterpreterService\.	a code interpreter API
^PtyHandle\.	a PTY API
\.(CreatePty|ConnectPty|CreatePtySession|GetPtySessionInfo|KillPtySession|ListPtySessions|ResizePtySession)$	a PTY API
^VolumeService\.	a volumes API
\.CodeRun$	a code interpreter API
\.(GetPreviewLink|GetSignedPreviewLink|ExpireSignedPreviewLink)$	a ports and preview links API
\.SetLabels$	a sandbox labels API
\.(SetAutoArchiveInterval|SetAutoDeleteInterval|Archive)$	a sandbox auto-archive and auto-delete API
\.(Resize|ResizeWithTimeout|WaitForResize)$	a sandbox resize API
\.ExperimentalFork	a create-sandbox-from-snapshot API
\.UpdateNetworkSettings$	a sandbox network policy update API
\.(.*Session.*|GetEntrypoint.*)$	a command sessions and entrypoint logs API
\.(GetUserHomeDir|GetWorkingDir)$	a sandbox environment API
